## Notes

This project was carried out as part of the **Flight Testing course within the MSc in Aeronautical Engineering at Politecnico di Milano**, using Pipistrel SW121 Explorer and SW128 Velis Electro aircraft.

The documentation represents team work by the two-person student group. I acted as **Team Leader and Flight Test Engineer**, contributing directly to the planning, in-flight execution, data reduction, analysis and final reporting.
